  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>Privacy and Terms of Usage</b>\n\nWe hereby inform you that\nPlus Games
    SARL collects,\nstores and transmit the following\npersonal data:\n\n- Installed
    apps (including the\nuse duration and use history)\n\n- Registration data (IP
    address, \nDevice ID, email)\n\n- Location (approximate)\n\n- Data for Attribution
    (User Agent,\nAD ID, Device ID)\n\n- Data for Personalised Ads\n(cookies, IDs)\n\nThe
    data will be connected to\nyour end device via the device ID and\nsent to our
    servers. In\norder for app providers to finance our\napp\nsuggestions, we must
    send\nthem the\ndevice ID for billing purposes.\n\nThe processing of the above\ndata
    is\nnecessary to be able to\nrecommend, via\nsystem messages, the\ninstallation
    of\napps available in Playtime\nthat match\nyour interests, and calculate\nthe\nbonuses
    acquired as a result\nof your\nuse of the corresponding\napps.\n\n**Consent**\n\nBy
    clicking on \u201CACCEPT\u201D, I give Plus Games SARL and adjoe GmbH my consent
    to process my above mentioned personal data and transmit it to other app providers
    so that I can use Playtime as described.\n\nl am aware that a profile of\ninterests
    will\nbe generated using the above\ndata, and\ndepending on the types of\napps
    I use,\nthis may contain particularly\nsensitive\npersonal data (e.g.\nhealth-related
    data or\ndata about my sexual orientation, and any other data in special categories\npursuant
    to Art. 9[1] GDPR). For\nthat\nreason my consent also\napplies\nexplicitly to
    the processing of\nthis data.\n\nThe full links to our <u><link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/Cashee-privacy\u201D>Privacy\nPolicy</link></u>,<u>\n<link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/Cashee-terms\u201D>Terms
    Of Use</link></u> and Adjoe's <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/en/data_privacy.html\u201D>Data\nPrivacy
    Statement</link></u> and <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/en/terms_of_use.html\u201D>Terms\nand
    Conditions of use</link></u>."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 978da8a99b0a02d4683753064da36308, type: 2}
